{
  "source": "FUNCTION_BLOCK FB_P04\nVAR_INPUT\n    VISCOSITY_OK : BOOL;\n    PASTE_E_STOP_NC : BOOL;\n    DebounceTime : TIME;\n    CycleTime : TIME;\nEND_VAR\nVAR_OUTPUT\n    VFD_RUN : BOOL := FALSE;\n    PUMP_MAINT_DUE : BOOL := FALSE;\n    PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC : LTIME := LTIME#0ns;\nEND_VAR\nVAR\n    StartupScans : USINT := 0;\n    PreviousViscosityOK : BOOL := FALSE;\n    ViscosityValid : BOOL := FALSE;\n    DebounceElapsed : LTIME := LTIME#0ns;\n    RequiredDebounce : LTIME := LTIME#0ns;\n    InvocationInterval : LTIME := LTIME#0ns;\nEND_VAR\nVAR CONSTANT\n    MaintenanceThreshold : LTIME := LTIME#500h;\n    MaximumRuntime : LTIME := LTIME#9223372036854775807ns;\nEND_VAR\n\n(*\n    编译profile须支持LTIME、长时间字面量及TIME_TO_LTIME；\n    本源码未声称经过编译或逐周期测试。\n\n    C10的文字说明为“首周期”，但G[0,1]按闭区间包含两个周期。\n    保留此解释差异：实现采用形式化边界，前两次调用均禁止运行。\n\n    C7要求原始粘度FALSE后的下一周期也禁止运行；\n    PreviousViscosityOK实现此约束，包括小于一个扫描的DebounceTime。\n\n    非正DebounceTime或CycleTime属于接口约束外输入：\n    安全处理为停泵、清除去抖，不清除累计时间或维护提示。\n*)\n\nVFD_RUN := FALSE;\n\nIF StartupScans < 2 THEN\n    StartupScans := StartupScans + 1;\n    DebounceElapsed := LTIME#0ns;\n    ViscosityValid := FALSE;\n    PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC := LTIME#0ns;\n    PUMP_MAINT_DUE := FALSE;\n\nELSIF NOT PASTE_E_STOP_NC THEN\n    (* 急停当周期停泵，并清除去抖状态。 *)\n    DebounceElapsed := LTIME#0ns;\n    ViscosityValid := FALSE;\n\nELSIF NOT VISCOSITY_OK THEN\n    (* 原始粘度失效立即作废，不采用断开延时。 *)\n    DebounceElapsed := LTIME#0ns;\n    ViscosityValid := FALSE;\n\nELSIF (DebounceTime <= T#0s) OR (CycleTime <= T#0s) THEN\n    DebounceElapsed := LTIME#0ns;\n    ViscosityValid := FALSE;\n\nELSE\n    RequiredDebounce := TIME_TO_LTIME(DebounceTime);\n    InvocationInterval := TIME_TO_LTIME(CycleTime);\n\n    (* 采用饱和加法，避免去抖时间加法溢出。 *)\n    IF DebounceElapsed >= RequiredDebounce THEN\n        DebounceElapsed := RequiredDebounce;\n    ELSIF InvocationInterval >= (RequiredDebounce - DebounceElapsed) THEN\n        DebounceElapsed := RequiredDebounce;\n    ELSE\n        DebounceElapsed := DebounceElapsed + InvocationInterval;\n    END_IF;\n\n    ViscosityValid := DebounceElapsed >= RequiredDebounce;\n\n    VFD_RUN := PASTE_E_STOP_NC\n               AND VISCOSITY_OK\n               AND ViscosityValid\n               AND PreviousViscosityOK;\n\n    (* 仅按本周期最终运行输出累计实际调用间隔。 *)\n    IF VFD_RUN THEN\n        IF InvocationInterval >= (MaximumRuntime - PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC) THEN\n            PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC := MaximumRuntime;\n        ELSE\n            PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC := PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC + InvocationInterval;\n        END_IF;\n    END_IF;\nEND_IF;\n\n(* 维护提示保持置位，且不参与任何运行许可判定。 *)\nIF PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC >= MaintenanceThreshold THEN\n    PUMP_MAINT_DUE := TRUE;\nEND_IF;\n\nPreviousViscosityOK := VISCOSITY_OK;\n\nEND_FUNCTION_BLOCK\n",
